(2217, 2, 'We love Red Velvet cake. It\'s Velvetty and.... Red! Blue doesn\'t work and green is gross.. What makes the Red Velvet red?', 'We have Yellow Lemon cake, Red Velvet.. Which desert cake is blue? ', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:37:56', '2025-12-05 02:10:30', 13, 10, 2, '2026-03-30 15:37:56'),
(2218, 2, 'You just had a great date with the homies! Dinner was good but you want some dessert! The cannoli looks tasty! Where are cannoli even from?', 'Every Cannoli ends up in the same place tho.. Sad cannoli life is sad', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:37:58', '2025-12-05 02:10:39', 13, 10, 4, '2026-03-30 15:37:58'),
(2219, 2, 'There are many different types of awards for movies and shows etc. Which award show is presented by the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences?', 'Why are there so many, why do we need so many awards?!', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:37:59', '2025-12-05 02:10:50', 5, 10, 4, '2026-03-30 15:37:59'),
(2220, 2, 'There was a Razzie award for an actress for her portrayal as Catwoman. Who famously accepted the award?', 'Razzies are the awards given for hot poopoo movies', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:00', '2025-12-05 02:10:56', 5, 10, 3, '2026-03-30 15:38:00'),
(2221, 2, 'Jack Nicholson currently (2025) holds the record for most Oscar nominations for male actors. Meryl Streep holds the record for female actresses. How many nominations is this? (We don\'t count anything past 2025)', 'She\'s even got more nominations than ANYONE ELSE EVER. Including you', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:01', '2025-12-05 02:11:07', 5, 10, 4, '2026-03-30 15:38:01'),
(2222, 2, 'In 1958, an actress won an Oscar for best actress in the movie \'I Want to Live!\'. Who was this actress?', 'Is it mean to ask questions about movies you have never heard of? Yes. Do I care? No', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:02', '2025-12-05 02:11:14', 5, 10, 5, '2026-03-30 15:38:02'),
(2223, 2, 'In the 2nd World War, England had the famous Spitfire fighter plane. Germany had the Messerschmitt Bf 109. Which company manufactured the engines in the Bf 109?', 'And here you are, drinking more booze than that engine drank gasoline', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:03', '2025-12-05 02:11:24', 9, 10, 4, '2026-03-30 15:38:03'),
(2224, 2, 'Larger passenger aircraft have small engines in the butts of the planes to provide the plane with power while the main engines aren\'t running. What are these butt engines called?', 'In the butt, because that\'s where the plane farts from', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:04', '2025-12-05 02:11:37', 9, 10, 3, '2026-03-30 15:38:04'),
(2225, 2, 'The Edmund Fitzgerald was a freight ship that sank in 1975. What was the type of freight ship she most referred as?', 'She split in two, and then sank. It was very tragic', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:05', '2025-12-05 02:11:45', 9, 10, 4, '2026-03-30 15:38:05'),
(2226, 2, 'Twitch is a live streaming service mostly focused on gaming and IRL-content. What was the original name before Twitch became Twitch?', 'Now we have Kick and... Youtube..', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:06', '2025-12-05 02:11:56', 12, 10, 3, '2026-03-30 15:38:06'),
(2227, 2, 'Sometimes I like to watch live streams without interacting with the streamer or his chat. What am I called by the streamer?', 'It\'s called \"being an introvert\" STOP CALLING ME OUT', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:07', '2025-12-05 02:12:05', 12, 10, 2, '2026-03-30 15:38:07'),
(2228, 2, 'A streaming service called Kick launched 2022 and is financially backed by a gambling website. Which gambling website?', 'DO NOT GAMBLE, SPEND YOUR MONEY ON HIMALAYAN SALT INSTEAD!', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:09', '2025-12-05 02:12:13', 12, 10, 3, '2026-03-30 15:38:09'),
(2229, 2, 'At some point in history, there was a streaming service that was owned by Microsoft. It died. What was the name of this live streaming website?', 'Whatever you do, do NOT go to reddit. I know it\'s not a live streaming service.. But just.. don\'t', 0, 0, '2025-12-04 15:22:46', '2026-03-30 15:38:15', '2025-12-05 02:12:24', 12, 10, 2, '2026-03-30 15:38:15'),
